<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS1.Px3" title="In III-B1 Step 1: Mapping Components to MAESTRO Layers ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer 3: Agent Frameworks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS1.Px4" title="In III-B1 Step 1: Mapping Components to MAESTRO Layers ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer 4: Deployment Infrastructure</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS1.Px5" title="In III-B1 Step 1: Mapping Components to MAESTRO Layers ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer 5: Evaluation &amp; Observability</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS1.Px6" title="In III-B1 Step 1: Mapping Components to MAESTRO Layers ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer 6: Security &amp; Compliance (Vertical)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS1.Px7" title="In III-B1 Step 1: Mapping Components to MAESTRO Layers ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer 7: Agent Ecosystem</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS2" title="In III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-B</span>2 </span>Step 2: Identifying and Mitigating Threats Using the Mapped Architecture</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS2.Px1" title="In III-B2 Step 2: Identifying and Mitigating Threats Using the Mapped Architecture ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Single Chokepoint (Tool-Gateway Agent) as a Central Mapping Control</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS2.Px2" title="In III-B2 Step 2: Identifying and Mitigating Threats Using the Mapped Architecture ‣ III-B Map Function ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dynamic System Context (Agent Name Service – ANS) for Ecosystem Mapping</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS3" title="In III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Measure Function: Scoring and Prioritization with AIVSS &amp; SSVC</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS1" title="In III-C Measure Function: Scoring and Prioritization with AIVSS &amp; SSVC ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>1 </span>Risk Quantification (OWASP AIVSS)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS2" title="In III-C Measure Function: Scoring and Prioritization with AIVSS &amp; SSVC ‣ III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>2 </span>Response Prioritization (SEI SSVC)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS4" title="In III Operationalizing the NIST AI RMF with AAGATE ‣ AAGATE: A NIST AI RMF-Aligned Governance Platform for Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Manage Function: Proactive Defense with CSA Red Teaming</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
